@{ViewData["Title"]="Privacy and service terms";}
<div class="page"><section class="panel"><h1>Privacy & service terms</h1><p>This is a development preview of Dalbo. These provisional terms must be reviewed for the launch market before public release.</p><h3>Your information</h3><p>We store account details, professional profiles, messages, appointment details and reviews to provide the service. Business contact details are public only when entered in your professional profile. Service addresses are accessible to the customer and booked professional.</p><h3>Appointments and payments</h3><p>An appointment request requires professional acceptance. Rates are estimates; agree the final price before work starts. Payments take place directly between customer and professional. Dalbo does not process payments in this release.</p><h3>Professional profiles</h3><p>Profile approval is an administrative publishing check and does not certify identity, licensing or qualifications. Customers should discuss the job and any relevant qualifications before booking.</p><h3>Acceptable use</h3><p>Provide accurate information. Do not send abusive, unlawful or unsolicited content. Administrators may suspend profiles for misuse.</p><h3>Data requests and support</h3><p>A production support contact, retention schedule and account deletion process must be configured before launch. Do not enter sensitive information in this development preview.</p></section></div>
